{{!--
    Centre track: the instrument's berth.

    In theatre of the mind this carries the day ring — the four quarters of
    the in-fiction day. It is empty in a fight on purpose: downtime is theatre
    of the mind played at city scale, and in combat time is measured in rounds,
    so a quarter-of-the-day dial there would be noise.

    The berth has a FIXED width (--bi-dome-size), so when it is empty it has to
    be hidden rather than merely childless or it holds a 252px gap open in the
    middle of the chassis. .bi-bar__instrument sets no `display`, so the plain
    [hidden] attribute is enough here (unlike the flex tracks either side).
--}}
<div class="bi-bar__instrument" data-track="instrument" {{#if tracks.instrument.hidden}}hidden{{/if}}>
    {{#each tracks.instrument.zones}}
    <section class="bi-pod" data-zone="{{this.id}}" data-partial="{{this.partial}}" {{#if this.hidden}}hidden{{/if}}>
        <h2 class="bi-legend">{{localize this.labelKey}}</h2>
        {{#if this.template}}{{> (lookup this 'template')}}{{/if}}
    </section>
    {{/each}}
</div>
